      "source": "To associate marker groups with an asset for playback, use the [`navigationMarkerGroups`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AVFoundation/AVPlayerItem/navigationMarkerGroups) property of an [`AVPlayerItem`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AVFoundation/AVPlayerItem) object.",
